  initialDialog:
  - "Ah\u2014there you are! You must be new around these parts. Name\u2019s Gut."
  - I see you arrived with empty pockets and empty hands.
  - "You\u2019ll need gear and supplies if you want to survive."
  - Head over to the town shop in the square and pick up whatever you need, then
    come back and tell me.
  acceptOption: "Got it. I\u2019ll visit the shop now."
  acceptAnswer: "Good choice. The shop\u2019s just down Main Street\u2014can\u2019t
    miss it."
  declineOption: Sorry, not right now.
  declineAnswer: "I understand\u2014but don\u2019t wander empty-handed too long."
  comebackAfterDecline: "Changed your mind? The shop awaits when you\u2019re ready."
  comebackInProgress: "Still haven\u2019t been to the shop? They\u2019ve got what
    you need."
  comebackCompleted: You made it to the shop! Nice haul, newcomer.
  finalWords: "Keep that gear safe\u2014adventure won\u2019t wait."
